# Ion product of water at 25 °C: Kw = \[H⁺\]·\[OH⁻\] = 1.0 × 10⁻¹⁴ (mol/L)².
#
# This is the conventional value (pKw = 14) that [`ph_from_poh`] also
# assumes; the measured value at 25 °C is 1.008 × 10⁻¹⁴ (pKw = 13.995).
